# Ansible: the pinned collection is installed, not committed. The pin is ansible/requirements.yml, which IS tracked - the
# ignored file is the installed tree only.
#
# The previous pattern was `ansible/collections/`, evaluated relative to this directory, so it resolved to
# `ansible/ansible/collections/` and ignored nothing: 306 vendored files were tracked for weeks (found 2026-11-18, story 15.7).
collections/
*.log
*.retry
